:: Start
!欢迎来到这座城市

这座城市从不入眠。显然，你也没有。

你在自己的小公寓里醒来。床头柜上的电子钟显示 <<print $time.hour>>:<<print String($time.minute).padStart(2, '0')>>。外面天气<<print $world.weather>>，透过薄薄的墙壁你能感受到<<if $world.temperature gte 25>>炎热<<else>>寒意<</if>>。

你的钱包里有 <<print "$" + $player.money>>。

<<if !(typeof LLMEngine !== 'undefined' && LLMEngine.isAvailable())>>
<div class="llm-error-banner">本作的叙事由 LLM 实时生成，尚未检测到可用配置。请先前往「LLM 配置」设置接口与模型，否则场景、选项与 NPC 对话将无法生成。</div>

<<action "前往 LLM 配置" "LLMConfig" "配置 Ollama 或兼容 OpenAI 的接口">>
<</if>>

<<if not $game.tutorialComplete>>
<div class="tutorial-hint">
<strong>提示：</strong>你的第一个任务是「新生活的第一天」。点击「起床看看」开始，注意管理体力、饥饿和压力。难度可在设置中调整。
</div>
<</if>>

你要做什么？

<<action "起床看看" "Bedroom" "开始你的一天">>
<<action "检查随身物品" "Inventory" "看看你拥有什么">>
<<action "打开设置" "Settings" "保存、读取或配置">>

<<silently>>
  <<if not $game.tutorialComplete and not ($quests.tutorial)>>
    <<set $quests.tutorial = {
      id: "tutorial",
      title: "新生活的第一天",
      description: "你刚搬到这座城市。先熟悉一下基本生存节奏吧。",
      giver: "",
      objectives: [
        {id: "sleep-once", text: "在卧室睡一次觉", type: "action", actionId: "tutorial:sleep", locations: ["Bedroom"], areas: ["bedroom_main"], required: 1, current: 0, completed: false},
        {id: "visit-street", text: "去街上看看", type: "visit", actionId: "tutorial:visit-street", locations: ["Street"], required: 1, current: 0, completed: false},
        {id: "buy-food", text: "在商店买一次食物", type: "purchase", actionId: "tutorial:buy-food", locations: ["Shop"], required: 1, current: 0, completed: false}
      ],
      rewards: ["金钱 10", "声望 2"],
      keywords: ["Bedroom", "Street", "Shop", "睡觉", "食物", "卧室", "商店"],
      status: "active",
      turnIn: {type: "automatic"},
      rewardsClaimed: false
    }>>
    <<set $activeQuestId to "tutorial">>
  <</if>>
<</silently>>
